# The foundation and third-party images, pinned together as the template tests them. Each value
# is tag@digest: the tag says which commit, and the digest makes sure that's what's pulled.
# Change only with `make pin` or by hand in the template, then run `make check` and `make smoke`.
# A module pins its own image in modules/<id>/versions.env, and a project that must differ
# overrides a line in site/versions.env. render.py merges them, later ones winning.
#
# Every foundation image is pinned here, the core's and each component's (foundation/components/),
# whether or not a project runs that component. Pinned Nov 15, 2026 from what `latest` pointed to;
# re-pinned Nov 17 (auth-server) and Nov 18 (auth-server, workbench, ai-gateway, collab, automations, livekit-agent), the ones `latest` had moved for.

# Foundation, public on ghcr.io.
T10_AUTH_SERVER=ghcr.io/xiant10/auth-server:sha-524993e@sha256:23bdc039aeab3e8bba9c7d201d70fa073a33b4dc31a285b17c7b483ba0fd0a83
